. Timing it right can change everything.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You'll Love Liar's Bar</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging multiplayer online experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling bar games focused on lying and deception </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with captivating backstories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates with new games and characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive bar simulation </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Cast</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097560/extras/9e13779be08ed8c9405ea96f61628c8f.avif?t=1794409990\" width=618 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, nine regulars bet their lives at this table — their pasts are murmured at the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover their whispered stories in Table Stories, available from the main menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay updated with the latest news and sneak peeks by following us on social media. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't miss out on the action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab a seat, order a drink, and get ready to lie!</strong></p>", "short_description": "Dive into this multiplayer online experience set in a sketchy bar where the games are as dangerous as the patrons. Join a table of 4 and test your skills in Liar's Dice and Liar's Deck, where lying and bluffing are key to victory. Ready for a night at Liar's Bar?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Simplified Chinese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image"